<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIA OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIA OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>UMAG, Croatia 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results of the</p>
<p>Croatia Open on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat 2-Carlos Moya (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 5-7 6-3</p>
<p>1-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Alberto Martin (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
